<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36239" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔντεχν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>within the range</i> or
				<i>province of art,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ πίστεις ἔντεχνόν ἐστι μόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1354a13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>furnished</i> or <i>invented by art, artificial, artistic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				321d
			</span></i>, al.; opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτεχνος, πίστεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1355b36
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἔ. μέθοδος</span> the
				<i>regular</i> method, ib.<i><span class="en">
				a4
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>SE</u>
					172a35
				</span></i>
			 (condemned by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				327
			</span></i> (who however cites Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶς</span> from <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				314
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>)). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of
			persons, <i>skilled,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. δημιουργός</span> a <i>cunning</i>
			workman, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				903c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Plt.</u>
				300e
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
